Right, since this is a street live, we're down to our last two songs, but please keep having fun.

215
00:27:15,426 --> 00:27:18,986
皆さん準備いいですか？
Are you guys ready?

216
00:27:19,606 --> 00:27:21,626
それでは、聞いてください。
Then please listen.

217
00:27:56,427 --> 00:28:00,807
ずっと弾けた感情に
To the emotions that finally burst open,

218
00:28:01,567 --> 00:28:04,867
理由を並べて過ごした
I spent my days lining up reasons.

219
00:28:07,127 --> 00:28:10,527
孤独も知らない街角に
At a street corner knowing no loneliness,

220
00:28:11,467 --> 00:28:16,607
君だけだって嘘をついた
I lied, saying it was only you.

221
00:28:17,467 --> 00:28:21,067
信じたくもないままで
Without even wanting to believe it,

222
00:28:21,367 --> 00:28:24,967
踊っている
I am dancing.

223
00:28:25,327 --> 00:28:30,867
示すために連ね続けた言葉は
The words I kept stringing together to prove myself

224
00:28:31,207 --> 00:28:35,807
見えないの僕が
Can't be seen by anyone,

225
00:28:36,127 --> 00:28:40,907
僕のこの声が聞こえてる？
Can you hear this voice of mine?

226
00:28:41,327 --> 00:28:44,967
残されたシルエットするも
Even the silhouette left behind

227
00:28:45,247 --> 00:28:49,687
透明できっと無カッコけれど
Is transparent and surely uncool, but

228
00:28:51,627 --> 00:29:00,227
でも、ささくれ立つ声が、絡そう、きしりしがっても、ずっと証明を願うよ
But even if my frayed voice screams, even if it creaks and strains, I will always wish to prove myself.

229
00:29:01,167 --> 00:29:04,847
みたいだ
It's like...

230
00:29:12,993 --> 00:29:17,793
心臓裏返した明るさと
With a brightness that turned my heart inside out,

231
00:29:18,143 --> 00:29:22,993
幾重針金に伸びてゆく影
Shadows stretching across countless wires.

232
00:29:23,743 --> 00:29:26,993
散々踏み過ぎた一つぶの
A single droplet I stepped on too many times,

233
00:29:27,543 --> 00:29:30,293
君の言葉で
With your words...

234
00:29:30,793 --> 00:29:35,793
抱きたくなった 大切にしたいものが
Things I wanted to hold, things I wanted to cherish

235
00:29:36,193 --> 00:29:40,893
こぼれてゆく 示せそのままで
Are spilling over. Show them just as they are,

236
00:29:41,343 --> 00:29:45,243
綴り続けたい 言葉に見えてるの僕が
I want to keep spelling out the words, can you see me?

237
00:29:45,543 --> 00:29:50,343
僕のこの声が届いてる？
Can this voice of mine reach you?

238
00:29:50,443 --> 00:30:00,168
残されたシルエット するもう透明で きっと無格好けれど
The silhouette left behind is already transparent, surely uncool, but...

239
00:30:00,578 --> 00:30:07,278
あの日の戸惑いはきっと 無謀だったけれど でも だから叫んで
That day's hesitation was surely a reckless choice, but that's precisely why I shouted

240
00:30:08,738 --> 00:30:16,978
新しいまま走れ ねえ 聞いて教えてよ
Running on just as I am, hey, listen and tell me

241
00:30:18,338 --> 00:30:27,958
こたえてよ 僕の心までばかり
Answer me, reaching all the way into my heart...

242
00:30:28,278 --> 00:30:30,598
つないで
connecting us—

243
00:30:45,478 --> 00:30:52,918
街灯りの街が笑ってる どう足にも重くなる
The streetlit town is smiling, and my steps feel heavier too

244
00:30:55,518 --> 00:31:01,518
これも交わして叫んであがいて 新たに走り続けて
Screaming and struggling through this too, I kept on running anew

245
00:31:02,318 --> 00:31:11,118
変わらないように 諦めないように つなぎ続けるだけだ
So that I wouldn't change, so that I wouldn't give up, I just keep connecting...

246
00:31:17,018 --> 00:31:23,218
見つけてよ 僕の この声が聞こえてる
Find me, can you hear this voice of mine?

247
00:31:27,978 --> 00:31:34,178
透明で きっと 無謀だったけれど でも 責めてこれを ガラスの霧にしがみついて
Transparent and surely reckless, but still, clinging to the glass fog with my voice—

248
00:31:44,078 --> 00:31:46,478
伝えたい
I want to convey it

249
00:32:07,078 --> 00:32:09,278
最後の曲も盛り上がっていきましょう！
Let's keep the excitement going for our final song!

250
00:32:23,378 --> 00:32:30,578
あの黄昏も 折り畳めば静まる 僕らの街じゃ
Even that twilight, if folded up, grows quiet in our town

251
00:32:31,378 --> 00:32:44,978
繋がりはいつも 光を消して 始めよう幕を開け 見上げ願いを あなたのように 必ず会いたい
Connections are always there; turn off the lights, let's open the curtain and raise our wishes to the night sky, wanting to surely meet just like you

252
00:32:46,578 --> 00:32:53,778
きらめきのベルも 手元にほしき星を描いて
Drawing the glittering bell and stars right at hand

253
00:32:54,778 --> 00:33:00,778
また泣いた ソワレ 今だネオン街を 出ようぜ
We cried again, soirée, let's leave the neon streets now

254
00:33:04,778 --> 00:33:10,278
頭の上の空を またぐ潮風を 挟んだな
Crossing the sky above our heads, catching the sea breeze in between

255
00:33:10,978 --> 00:33:17,178
引っこ抜くお茶 そうあれ 夜が明けるまで もう少し
Pulling it out, soirée, just a little longer until dawn breaks

256
00:33:30,178 --> 00:33:34,778
あの彼女らは 誰にさされたって
Those girls, whoever was stabbed by them—

257
00:33:34,978 --> 00:33:41,378
たまらない 時間が集まろう 夜見に重さえを
Gathering unbearable time, weighting down the night view

258
00:33:41,978 --> 00:33:45,178
未来の話を すみれしそうに来てふいに
Coming to talk about the future so violetly, abruptly...

259
00:33:45,978 --> 00:33:52,378
違うよ 世界に 魔法がかかっている 夢は続いてく
No, magic is cast upon the world, the dream goes on

260
00:33:56,978 --> 00:34:02,578
おやすみに代わるよ もたれやまない メロディ
Turning into a goodnight, a melody that never stops leaning on us

261
00:34:03,278 --> 00:34:10,278
届けてよ 見逃すな 僕らの目撃者だ
Deliver it, don't miss it, we are the witnesses!

262
00:34:10,678 --> 00:34:17,278
すぐ返サインが立ってしたって 駆け橋は立ったな
Even if a sign was quickly erected, a bridge was built

263
00:34:17,978 --> 00:34:24,278
いつの日か ソワレ 君に届くまでさ 何度でも
Someday, soirée, until it reaches you, no matter how many times—

264
00:34:27,978 --> 00:34:30,678
乗り越えて
overcome it!

265
00:34:33,278 --> 00:34:40,278
君の奇跡だって 映し出そうの どこまででも
Even your miracle, let's reflect it, no matter how far

266
00:34:49,178 --> 00:34:55,278
二人なんか 語り尽くせない 悲劇も
Tragedies that the two of us can never fully talk about...

267
00:34:55,678 --> 00:35:00,678
語り合わせたら 劇的になっていく
If we talk them through together, they will turn into something dramatic.

268
00:35:01,356 --> 00:35:02,966
あ、そのあと、あのTwitterにも載せるから
Oh, and after that, I'm going to post it on Twitter too,

269
00:35:02,966 --> 00:35:04,816
あのYouTubeのみんなもね、安心してね
so everyone on YouTube, you can rest assured.

270
00:35:04,816 --> 00:35:06,266
うん
Yeah.

271
00:35:06,266 --> 00:35:08,916
えー、名残惜しいね
Man, I'm really going to miss this.

272
00:35:08,916 --> 00:35:12,866
もうね、もう台本にはね、これで星街すいせいでしたバイバイって書いてあるんだ
The script already says, "That's all from Hoshimachi Suisei, bye-bye!"

273
00:35:12,866 --> 00:35:14,066
名残惜しいね
I'm really going to miss this.

274
00:35:14,066 --> 00:35:15,316
名残惜しい
I really am.

275
00:35:15,316 --> 00:35:19,316
え、なんか、最後にさ、言ってほしい言葉とかある？
Uh, is there anything you want me to say at the very end?

276
00:35:19,316 --> 00:35:20,716
わかりました
Understood.

277
00:35:20,716 --> 00:35:21,616
それでは
Well then...

278
00:35:21,616 --> 00:35:23,116
あ、バッチコーイ！
Oh, bring it on!

279
00:35:23,116 --> 00:35:25,716
バッチコーイ！
Bring it on!

280
00:35:25,716 --> 00:35:26,816
あと、あと、は？
What else? What else?

281
00:35:26,816 --> 00:35:31,716
え？うーん...
Uh... hmm...

282
00:35:31,716 --> 00:35:36,216
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

283
00:35:36,216 --> 00:35:36,666
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

284
00:35:36,666 --> 00:35:37,416
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

285
00:35:37,416 --> 00:35:38,316
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

286
00:35:38,316 --> 00:35:39,466
また！ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Again! Zombie, zombie, zombie!

287
00:35:39,466 --> 00:35:40,366
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

288
00:35:40,366 --> 00:35:41,316
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Zombie, zombie, zombie!

289
00:35:41,316 --> 00:35:42,516
ラスト！ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
Last one! Zombie, zombie, zombie!

290
00:35:42,516 --> 00:35:46,066
